{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111838","id":2928906967,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6uk5LX","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111838","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111838.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111838.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111838","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111838/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111838/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111838/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/6b842975ea79a28f79a2c746dc6c78f608d3b46b","number":111838,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix GDScript debugger polls too early","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- *Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111656*\r\n\r\n## Issue Description\r\n\r\nWhen there is a theme with gdscript. We need load theme before main scene.\r\n\r\n1. Load theme.tres\r\n2. Load sub-resource (gdscript) of theme\r\n3. Set script to theme (Texture2D). And in `set_script()` we will create instance for the script, which will invoke `implicit_new` function of this script.\r\n4. When debugger enabled, `implict_new()` function will call `EngineDebugger::get_singleton()->line_poll()`, I guess it try to refresh the current debug information.\r\n5. The calling of `line_poll()` is too early, we didnot load main scene, yet. So the error messages reported.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7864ac80192e9e91bf56176af9f04cc013b580aa/modules/gdscript/gdscript_vm.cpp#L3906\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nI add a `started` flag to `EngineDebugger`, to decide whether main scene had been loaded.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https: